title: "Boolean-Valued Analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Sabean"
    given-names: "Steven"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-9238-610X"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SteveWmoc/boolean-valued-analysis"
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "0.2.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22696492"
abstract: >-
  An experimental Lean 4 formalization of the foundations of Boolean-valued set
  theory and Boolean-valued analysis, including Boolean-valued semantics, a
  separated universe, ZF/ZFC transfer, internal Dedekind reals and Boolean
  spectral families, spectral arithmetic, and Takeuti's definite-set/function
  correspondence with checked-natural sequence specialization.
keywords:
  - "Lean 4"
  - "formalized mathematics"
  - "Boolean-valued analysis"
  - "Boolean-valued models"
  - "set theory"
  - "forcing"
